gatt-profile 1
# HM-10 style single-characteristic serial module: service FFE0, characteristic FFE1 that both
# notifies and is written. Source: a search-result excerpt of the DSD TECH HM-10 datasheet saying
# "Notify and Write"; the datasheet itself was not read, so whether the write is with or without
# response is unknown and both are listed. The 2902 is implied by notify.
device-name Example HM10
adv-service ffe0

service ffe0 primary
  characteristic ffe1 notify,write,write-no-response
    descriptor 2902 value=0000
